{"id":"212cd08391c68bb4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-sobolev-embedding.md","title":"Sobolev Embedding Theorem","display":"thm-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-sobolev-embedding","aliases":["58-thm-sobolev-embedding"],"display":"thm-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-sobolev-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-sobolev-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sobolev-embedding — Sobolev Embedding Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38c58fda0da62833\" href=\"?note=38c58fda0da62833\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bfb4dca042a4697a\" href=\"?note=bfb4dca042a4697a\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md\">../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d47484adcb88c697\" href=\"?note=d47484adcb88c697\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e5a0510b115e1b59\" href=\"?note=e5a0510b115e1b59\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md\">../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"707325cb0230c081\" href=\"?note=707325cb0230c081\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md\">../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1&lt;p&lt;\\infty\">\\(1&lt;p&lt;\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(q\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\">\\(\\Omega\\in\\tau_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\|x\\|_2&lt;R)\">\\(\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\|x\\|_2&lt;R)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{1,p}(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{1,p}(\\Omega)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 分别取 <code>58-df-sobolev-space</code>、<code>58-df-fourier-sobolev-space</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\">\\(C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\)</span> 及其范数取 <code>58-df-holder-function-space</code>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-sobolev-extension-domain</code> 的有界线性延拓定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 为 <code>58-df-sobolev-embedding</code> 中已有的二参数关系，所有空间、测度、范数在同一上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 中固定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}morrey}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1&lt;p&lt;\\infty\\land p&gt;n\\land\\alpha=1-\\frac np\\land\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{1,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}morrey}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1&lt;p&lt;\\infty\\land p&gt;n\\land\\alpha=1-\\frac np\\land\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{1,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}sobolev}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;s&lt;\\frac n2\\land q=\\frac{2n}{n-2s}\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}sobolev}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s\\in\\mathbb R\\land0&lt;s&lt;\\frac n2\\land q=\\frac{2n}{n-2s}\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first line is Morrey's embedding for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{1,p}\">\\(W^{1,p}\\)</span>; the exponent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-n/p\">\\(1-n/p\\)</span> is not the general exponent for arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}\">\\(W^{k,p}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>On a bounded Lipschitz domain, Rellich–Kondrachov gives compact embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^q(\\Omega)\">\\(W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^q(\\Omega)\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"kp&lt;n\">\\(kp&lt;n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q&lt;np/(n-kp)\">\\(q&lt;np/(n-kp)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Gagliardo–Nirenberg inequality generalizes these results.</li>\n<li>Critical exponents appear in nonlinear PDE and concentration-compactness.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"38c58fda0da62833","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"bfb4dca042a4697a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d47484adcb88c697","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"e5a0510b115e1b59","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-holder-function-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"707325cb0230c081","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-sobolev-extension-domain.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"1<p<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in[1,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\in\\tau_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists R\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\|x\\|_2<R)","display":false},{"tex":"W^{1,p}(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)","display":false},{"tex":"C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sobolev\\text{-}morrey}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land1<p<\\infty\\land p>n\\land\\alpha=1-\\frac np\\land\\operatorname{ExtensionDomain}_S(\\Omega,1,p,n)\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(W^{1,p}(\\Omega),C^{0,\\alpha}(\\overline\\Omega)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}sobolev}\\vdash n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s\\in\\mathbb R\\land0<s<\\frac n2\\land q=\\frac{2n}{n-2s}\\to\\mathrm{SobolevEmbedding}_S\\bigl(H^s(\\mathbb R^n),L^q(\\mathbb R^n)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"W^{1,p}","display":false},{"tex":"1-n/p","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}","display":false},{"tex":"W^{k,p}(\\Omega)\\hookrightarrow L^q(\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"kp<n","display":false},{"tex":"q<np/(n-kp)","display":false}],"bytes":2102,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4425","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-sobolev-embedding.md|58-thm-sobolev-embedding]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["38c58fda0da62833","bfb4dca042a4697a","d47484adcb88c697","e5a0510b115e1b59","707325cb0230c081"]}